WEBVTT

00:07:28.944 --> 00:07:34.283
“Because even if it were my period week,

00:07:34.283 --> 00:07:37.661
I might have already
brought some with me."

00:07:37.703 --> 00:07:39.747
(Laughter)

00:07:39.788 --> 00:07:41.373
"But, you know ...

00:07:43.834 --> 00:07:45.586
Thanks, I guess."

00:07:46.545 --> 00:07:48.255
One hundred tampons.

00:07:48.297 --> 00:07:53.427
How does she use a tampon
when they tied the strings together?

00:07:55.054 --> 00:07:57.598
One hundred tampons.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:59.016
Don't hate me.

00:07:59.016 --> 00:08:03.312
525,600 tampons --